SUMMARY:Wednesday Jazz: Spring & Summer
DESCRIPTION:On The Patio\nDanny Iannucci & Friends are back for a Spring & Summer series of delightful jazz\, delicious drink specials and your go-to mid-week wind down. Join us from 6-8p April-August to enjoy the fabulous jazz trio & 1/2 Off Wine\, $10 Specialty Martinis\, and $4 Select Craft Drafts. \nFree to attend and all ages are welcome. \n*Rain or Extreme temps will bring us indoors.
