SUMMARY:Tool Trivia with the Asheville Tool Library
DESCRIPTION:Power tools to power ballads – let’s wrench your brain about tools in songs\, books\, movies\, history and MORE!\n\n\n\n\nGrab your team of up to 4 and put your brains to the test across four rounds of 8 questions: songs with tools in the title\, tools in movies and books\, the history behind your favorite tools\, and the everyday tools that actually get the job done. No tool experience required\, just a love of weird facts\, friendly competition\, and a good pun! \nThis is a sliding-scale\, pay-what-you-can event\, and every dollar raised goes directly to supporting the Asheville Tool Library: a volunteer-powered\, tool-lending nonprofit with over 4\,000 tools available to borrow. For the past ten years\, AvlTL has grown to support our community in even bigger ways\, including a community garden\, seed library\, firewood program\, and communal art space. Your support helps keep tools and resources in the hands of neighbors who need them! \nThe top-scoring team takes home a gift basket loaded with tools\, ATL merch\, and gift cards from local spots. There will also be a raffle with additional prizes throughout the night\, so bring some extra cash for tickets! \n\n Register Here! \n\n 
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/tool-trivia-with-the-asheville-tool-library/
CATEGORIES:Hosting with Friends
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/1-3.png?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=f55fbc3334fc9976622e6e3a70127700
END:VEVENT
