SUMMARY:Futbol828 x The Mule
DESCRIPTION:Futbol828 is at The Mule Every Thursday!\nWe’re thrilled to welcome our friends from Futbol828 to The Mule for pop-up Futbol events! Each Thursday\, you can expect to gather with friends and participate in soccer-related games and activities\, all leading up to the launch of a 4 v. 4 league in August! \nThe Week-by-Week Breakdown\nThursday\, July 9th | Watch Party & Youth Activities \nThursday\, July 16th| PK Shootout (or Futbol Activities) \nThursday\, July 23rd | Mini Tournament \nThursday\, July 30th | Futbol & Social Camp \nThursday\, August 13th | Official League Kickoff \nAsheville Tekkers 4 v. 4 League\n \n  \nScheduled to start August 13th\, but you can check out more league details and registration updates below! \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n Registration & Info!
