SUMMARY:Rock The Block: Summer Sendoff Block Party
DESCRIPTION:Our End of Summer Block Party is Back!\nAnd this time we’re rockin’ out with some amazing local bands! \nThe winners of Battle of the Bands\, back in February\, will open the day with a killer set of iconic Rock! Fair Warning is Asheville’s youngest Van Halen tribute band\, delivering the electrifying sound and swagger of rock legends Eddie Van Halen and David Lee Roth. Formed by five young musicians united by their passion for Van Halen’s iconic ’70s and ’80s catalog\, the band brings classic arena-rock energy to every stage they hit. \nFresh off their album release “Trust the Process”\, our friends Fully Processed will take the stage to close out the day with their unique improvisational take on Funk\, Jazz & Rock styles. \nAnd true to Mule Block Party fashion\, we’ll have a bounce house for the kiddos\, delicious drink specials\, and free food for all! \nLet’s send the Summer off with a bang!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/rock-the-block-summer-sendoff-block-party/
CATEGORIES:Free & Fun!,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/Rock-the-Block-8.5x11-Instagram-Post-45-1.png?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=5ec3d704e1be4e0c7aaa6138507bcfb4
END:VEVENT
